      "kind": "subsection",
      "he": "",
      "en": "It's Sukkos! Time to Unite All Jews Like One to Serve Hashem"
    },
    {
      "kind": "callout",
      "body": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "It is important to think a bit before you do a mitzvah so that you will be doing it for the correct reasons! This is especially true with the mitzvah of lulav and esrog, since it carries with it so many different symbolisms and has deep Kabbalistic meaning. Therefore, some say the following Yehi Ratzon before taking the lulav."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
