      "en": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "—May it be Your will, Hashem, that by me taking the Arba'ah Minim—the esrog, lulav, hadassim, and aravos (which, according to the Kabbalah, correspond to the four letters of the Name of Hashem)—the four letters of Your Name \"become united in my hand\"—that I will feel Your Divine Presence, and that any evil will sense Your Presence and therefore be afraid to attack me. And may my waving of the Arba'ah Minim cause blessing to flow down from the Heavens down to the place where Your Beis Hamikdash (which will hopefully soon be rebuilt)"
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 0
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "—You, Hashem, are the Source of everything; מֶלֶךְ—You take care of us; אֱלֹהֵינוּ—You rule the entire world; אֲשֶׁר קִדְּשָׁנוּ בְּמִצְוֹתָיו—and through Your mitzvos You elevated us; וְצִוָּנוּ עַל נְטִילַת—and commanded us concerning the mitzvah of taking the lulav."
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 2
        }
      ],
